# The files under x/ are byte-exact content lifted off SINTRAN packs. Some carry
# ND-100 even parity, some have CR-only line endings, some are mixed, and the
# :PROG / :BPUN / :BRF files are raw memory images. Git must not touch any of it:
# with core.autocrlf=true a checkout would rewrite line endings and the files
# would no longer match the pack they came from.
x/** -text

# The merged 68000 firmware image.
RE/*.BIN -text
